  "outlook_text": "The Company is maintaining its 2016 share repurchase target of $400 million of the Company’s common shares. During July 2016, the Company committed to pricing on private placement debt in the aggregate principal amount of $350.0 million ... The commitment is expected to be finalized and proceeds received during the fourth quarter of 2016.",
